    "user_title": "Build Better Go Tests",
    "value_statement": "Go teams need consistent tests across units, integrations, mocks, benchmarks, and coverage. This skill provides practical Go testing patterns that Claude, Codex, and Claude Code can apply during development.",
    "seo_keywords": [
      "Claude Go testing",
      "Codex Go tests",
